        "id": 1039338
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-11-27T15:15:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This makes it sound like an error that a \u003cuses-library\u003e is missing from the source manifest but in fact that is often by design. Allowing Soong to calculate the entries is less prone to errors and simplifies maintenance.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 131,
