      "writtenOn": "2020-11-27T15:15:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do we have any way to check that the dependencies which PackageManager has are the same as the ones used at build time? What happens if new dependencies are added in APEX\u0027s? I presume that the PackageManager uses dependency information from the APEX not fixed in /system/etc/permissions/platform.xml.",
