      "writtenOn": "2020-11-27T18:11:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, there build-time CLC is hardcoded in the *.odex files (the tree + checksums for each library). If that is not the same as whatever PM constructs, dexpreopted code is discarded. (Mentioned in section 3).\n\nI don\u0027t know how APEXes provide \"shared\" libraries (this looks like another global list in the build system, similar to boot jars, that has to be gathered across APEXes in some way, similar to BOOTCLASSPATH environment variables).",
